Rule 1 (input must be a tensor)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (input dtype must be floating-point to avoid unsupported integer types)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8
