Rule 3 (if inplace is requested, the input must still be a valid floating-point tensor)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = true then (dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8)
>>
Rule 4 (shape indices are valid for all axes when the tensor has dimensions)
{v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 then ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) ≥ 0
